# inc-caq8: shared setup for a loaded fixture; freeze monsters, acquire scrolls.
@until "Wizard Mode Options" w y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*10 SPACE ESC
w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT DOWN*116
@expect "Scroll of Wizard Sight"
ENTER
@while "In the Air':Scroll" s
@while "Ready Hand" ESC
w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT DOWN*116
@expect "Scroll of Wizard Sight"
ENTER
@while "In the Air':Scroll" s
@while "Ready Hand" ESC
i
@dump:setup-pack
ESC
